overview:
Fitusiran may cause blood clots. Your doctor will monitor you carefully if you are at risk for blood clots. If you experience any of the following symptoms, call your doctor immediately or get emergency medical care: swelling, pain or redness in arms or
legs;
coughing up blood;
shortness of breath;
severe chest pain or tightness of the
chest;
fast heart rate;
feeling faint
or fainting; severe or ongoing headache;
difficulty speaking or understanding what
is being said; feel confused;
numbness or weakness in your face,
arms or legs;
eye pain or swelling, or sudden loss or changes in your vision.
